  "extractionNotes": "ZUS internal note on page 1 records payment of maternity benefit for 2026-09-14..2026-11-08 (56 days); no decision, rate not printed (100% expected). The stillbirth date is redacted in the leave application; the 8-week leave runs from the birth day and starts 2026-09-14, and the Z-3 shows employer sick pay 2026-09-11..2026-09-13 directly before it, so event.date is inferred as 2026-09-14. Proof is a hospital certificate that the child was stillborn (plus a mirrored scan, probably the stillbirth card); no registry-act status is visible, so no document code is set. Z-3 salary table 2025-09..2026-08 = 12 months before the month of incapacity; column 8 holds engagement bonuses taken at actual amount (contributionBase = col. 6 + col. 8, inferred). The Z-3 gives full time from 2025-09-08 (earlier fraction not stated); 2025-09 is printed at a lower fixed amount. The Z-3 application-date box is not reliably legible; asOf and applicationDate use the date of the leave application to the employer. Base and amounts not printed."
